      "id": 10146,
      "name": "Medic-Tank",
      "username": "Medic-Tank",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/medic-tank/{size}/2107_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-04-16T22:53:22.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The kickstarter update 18 hints that Dr. Blake Washington isn't Ra anymore. While it could be pretty much anybody I'm more inclined to believe it is a character we already saw. It sounds like Ra got a younger more inexperieced hostr but a really motivated one. I used to laugh at how often Thiago theories kept popping up everywhere but it did strike me that since tactics is a few years later he could have had some time to mature a bit and that he could have the brash fiery disposition to face danger and his more cooperative mood with the freedom five could come from finally being able to work with his youth heroes including Legacy.</p><p>Feel free to post your own theories and debate on this thread.</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:41:07.023Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
