      "created_at": "2014-04-17T00:47:52.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I wouldn't see why Atum would suddenly have become even more cooperative in general and even more with the freedom five... Oh yeah even thought I pushed out the theory that Thiago could be new Ra he could be retconned for all I care, I just felt that if he was gonna become important at some point taking the Ra mantle could do the trick. It's also worthy to know that we don't know the exact effect of the staff of Ra on ones body as I believe the only image we have of a Ra host not being Ra is on Excavation.</p>",
